---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { app, links } from '../config';
---
<Base title="App updates" description="Follow MacDigiPet development. The first beta is being prepared for testers in Discord; no release date has been set.">
  <div class="wrap narrow page">
    <h1>Follow MacDigiPet’s progress</h1>
    <p><strong>MacDigiPet is free and will always be free.</strong> Support is optional and never required for access.</p>
    <p>The app is in development. The first beta is being prepared for a small group of testers, and it will open up to more people over time. No release date has been set. Join Discord for updates and conversation, whether or not you want to test.</p>
    <div class="row actions"><a class="btn" href={links.discord} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Join Discord</a><a class="btn alt" href="/wallpaper">Get the free wallpaper</a></div>
    <h2>Future app builds</h2>
    <p>Builds are shared with testers in Discord first. Each one comes with release notes covering the version, requirements (currently macOS {app.minMacOS}) and installation steps. You can <a href="/beta">read how the beta works</a> and share your interest.</p>
    <p>Want to see what changed lately? The <a href="/devlog">Dev Log</a> has the latest progress notes.</p>
    <h2>Need a hand?</h2>
    <p>Ask about the project or share ideas in <a href={links.discord} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Discord</a>. You don’t need to sign up for testing to join the conversation.</p>
    <p>Enjoying the project? You can <a href="/support">support the developer</a> with an optional tip, or simply share feedback.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
